    kg:docId "1903.00402_rag" ;
    kg:inPaper <http://example.org/kg/paper/1903_00402_rag> ;
    kg:textSpan "regression, a problem that is more serious with small sample sizes or weak instruments (Mullainathan and Spiess, 2017). A number of recent studies have used ML for the rst stage of the IV models. Belloni et al. (2012) use lasso, while Hansen and Kozbur (2014) use ridge regression. More recently, a TMLE has been developed for IV models, which uses ML ts also for the initial target parameter estimation (Tth and van der Laan, 2016). Double robust IV estimators can also be used with machine learning" .

