    kg:textSpan "Adapting Neural Networks for the Estimation of Treatment Effects Claudia Shi 1 , David M. Blei 1,2 , and Victor Veitch 2 1 Department of Computer Science, Columbia University 2 Department of Statistics, Columbia University arXiv:1906.02120v2 [stat.ML] 17 Oct 2019 Abstract This paper addresses the use of neural networks for the estimation of treatment effects from observational data. Generally, estimation proceeds in two stages. First, we t models for the expected outcome and the probability of t" .

<http://example.org/kg/chunk/1906_03485_rag__chunk_003> a kg:Chunk ;
