    kg:textSpan "that the difference between 1 http://www.causality.inf.ethz.ch/cause-effect.php 2 humans and neural networks can be summarized as two fold: (1) people learn from fewer examples. (2) people learn the concept of a task, which is more than how to recognize patterns. Following the previous studies, this paper aims to try to understand the performance of human workers through analyzing the similarity between humans and machines toward improving human workers. Also, our study is rst to use the cause-e" .

