    kg:textSpan "Reducing Selection Bias in Counterfactual Reasoning for Individual Treatment Effects Estimation Zichen Zhang , Qingfeng Lan , Lei Ding , Yue Wang , Negar Hassanpour , Russell Greiner Department of Computing Science Department of Mathematical and Statistical Sciences University of Alberta {zichen2,qlan3,lding1,yue9,hassanpo,rgreiner}@ualberta.ca arXiv:1912.09040v1 [cs.LG] 19 Dec 2019 Abstract Counterfactual reasoning is an important paradigm applicable in many elds, such as healthcare, economics," .

