    kg:textSpan "introduced a cross-covariance penalty (XCov) for this purpose. It disentangled factors like the hand-writing style from the digits labels. We improve their work by introducing a penalty term that better reects the correlation between random variables, as detailed in the next section. 3 Proposed method 3.1 Network Architecture Following the model of deep-treat in [Atan et al., 2018] and the Counter Factual Regression (CFR) framework in [Shalit et al., 2017], the overall structure of our method is" .

