    kg:textSpan "2016; Zhang et al. 2017, 2018) have been proposed to address the problem by designing a treatment effect specic splitting criterion for recursive partitioning. Ensemble algorithms and meta algorithms (Kunzel et al. 2019; Wager and Athey 2018) have also been explored. For example, Causal Forest(Wager and Athey 2018) builds ensembles using the Causal Tree (Athey and Imbens 2016) as base learners. X-Learner (Kunzel et al. 2019) is a meta algorithm that can utilize off-the-shelf machine learning alg" .

