        "qidong20a_rag::chunk_002"^^xsd:string ;
    :hasEvidenceText "Covariates may include four kinds of variables: confounders, instrument variables, adjustment variables and irrelevant variables."^^xsd:string,
        "Such covariates include: (1) colliders, (2) intermediate variables on the causal pathways between treatment and outcome"^^xsd:string,
        "adjustment for the scalar propensity score is enough to remove bias due to all observed covariates"^^xsd:string,
        "covariates x"^^xsd:string,
        "given the individuals pre-treatment covariates."^^xsd:string,
        "individuals are described by a set of covariates X X R d"^^xsd:string,
        "there is a wide range of variables (covariates) that can inuence both infants cognitive outcomes and whether or not they receive treatments"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:skos_definition "Variables that may influence the causal pathway or bias estimates, including colliders and intermediate variables."^^xsd:string ;
