    :hasEvidenceText "All treated (untreated or controlled) individuals receive the same version of treatment"^^xsd:string,
        "Assuming there is a set of treatments t"^^xsd:string,
        "We t the treatment model in the rst stage"^^xsd:string,
        "it assumes that there only exists one version for each treatment."^^xsd:string,
        "the group of individuals receiving the treatment is collectively referred to as the treatment group"^^xsd:string,
        "the treatment variable takes binary values t { 0 , 1 } . Without loss of generality, t i = 1 ( t i = 0) means that the i -th instance is under treatment (control)."^^xsd:string,
        "treatment assigned to other individuals"^^xsd:string,
        "variables that cannot be affected by taking a treatment. Some clinical presentations and medical tests are affected by taking medications"^^xsd:string ;
    rdfs:subClassOf :entity,
        owl:Thing ;
    skos:skos_definition "A variable that takes binary values to indicate whether an instance is under treatment or control."^^xsd:string ;
